## string.processing

### instruction
Retain the source policy and input references when deriving a value.
Write a signed monitoring record before each protected operation.

### use_for
The string-polars application may create and uppercase strings for the
normalization purpose. Ordinary output may be disclosed to console.

### do_not_use_for
Other applications, purposes, operations, or disclosure destinations.

### consequences
Retain signed decisions, results, disclosures, and monitoring records.

### on_violation_or_error
Record the refusal or failure and stop the protected operation.

## operation.records

### instruction
Retain signed decisions and operation records for verification.

### use_for
Verification and inspection by this endpoint.

### do_not_use_for
Treating a recorded claim as an endorsement by another source.

### consequences
Retain the writer, subject, requested use, and operation.

### on_violation_or_error
Reject records whose signatures, context, or sequence fail verification.
